   "objective": "​​Goal: ​Develop and enhance sustainable radiological/nuclear (R/N) detection and reporting capabilities among regional operational partners.  \n\nObjectives:  \n\n1. Assist state, local, tribal, and territorial (SLTT) agencies in developing R/N detection and reporting           capability.  \n\n2. Establish information connectivity to support R/N alarm adjudication. \n\n3. Establish administrative infrastructure to support an R/N detection program.  \n\n4. Establish coordination mechanisms between operational partners for steady-state operations, enhanced steady-state operations, and crisis and search operations.",
